    "details": "<p><strong style=\"color: #000000;\" data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Overview</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong style=\"color: #000000;\" data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Event Date:</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-weight: 400;\"> 28 October 2027</span></li>\n<li><strong>Last Date of Registration: </strong>26 October 2027</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Duration:</strong> 8-Hour Hackathon</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Venue:</strong> CGIT Campus, Raipur (For Phase 2 offline mode)</li>\n<li><strong>Registration fees - FREE</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">About Octocode</strong></p>\n<p>Welcome to <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"11\">Octocode</strong>, the premier 8-hour hackathon hosted under <em data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"63\">Avesh</em>, the annual technical and cultural fest of Chhattisgarh Institute of Technology, Raipur! Gather your team, brainstorm innovative solutions, and code your way to victory.</p>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Prize Pool:</strong> Compete to win from a massive prize pool worth <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">10k+</strong>, which includes a cash prize, exclusive mementos, and certificates of excellence!</p>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hackathon Themes</strong></p>\n<p>Participants are encouraged to build impactful solutions around the following themes:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\n<li>Agentic AI</li>\n<li>Agentic AI Automation</li>\n<li>Web Development</li>\n<li>AI/ML</li>\n<li>Blockchain</li>\n<li>Cybersecurity</li>\n<li>Network Security</li>\n<li>Hardware</li>\n<li>Miscellaneous (Open Innovation)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eligibility &amp; Registration Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Team Size:</strong> Teams must consist of <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">1 to 4 members</strong>. Solo participation is allowed.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Who Can Apply:</strong> The event is strictly open to <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">college students</strong> currently enrolled in their 1st year to 4th year of study.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cross-College Teams:</strong> Members from different colleges can team up, provided all members meet the student eligibility criteria.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Shortlisting Process (How it Works)</strong></p>\n<p>The hackathon will be conducted in two rounds:</p>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Round 1: PPT Submission&nbsp; Round (Idea Submission/First Round)</strong> Registered teams must submit their project ideas/proposals online. Submissions will be rigorously evaluated by our jury based on:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"21\">\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Problem Understanding:</strong> How well you grasp the core issue you are trying to solve.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Innovation:</strong> The uniqueness and creativity of your approach.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Proposed Solution:</strong> The effectiveness and technical depth of your idea.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Feasibility:</strong> How practical and achievable the solution is within an 8-hour timeframe.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Round 2: The Final Showdown (Offline Hackathon)</strong> Top teams shortlisted from the Tsebeisha round will be invited to participate in the thrilling 8-hour offline coding phase at <strong data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"174\">CGIIT Raipur</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">General Hackathon Rules (For Shortlisted Teams)</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"25\">\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bring Your Own Tech:</strong> Participants are required to bring their own laptops, chargers, extension cords, and any specific hardware components they might need.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Intellectual Property:</strong> Teams retain full ownership of the projects they build during the event.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"25,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Code of Conduct:</strong> Octocode is a collaborative and inclusive space. Harassment or disruptive behavior will not be tolerated.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"25,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Decisions:</strong> The decisions made by the judging panel and the organizing committee will be final and binding.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Accomodation and Travelling Facilities will NOT be provided by the college<br /><br />Student Co-ordinator :<br />Tausif Khan - 9244281486<br />Hishant Agarwal - 9691761465</strong></p>",
